+==================================================================================================+
|                                    WORKER THREAD PIPELINE                                        |
|                                                                                                  |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   | Snapshot Read (T_read)                                                                   |   |
|   |   EpochManager::enter_epoch(ReaderState)                                                 |   |
|   |   Traverse PageVersion chain via head.load(memory_order_acquire)                         |   |
|   |   Filter: (v.commit_ts <= T_read) && (v.lsn <= GlobalLsnWatermark.load(acquire))        |   |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
|                                             |                                                    |
|                                             v                                                    |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   | OCC Validation & Commit (T_commit)                                                       |   |
|   |   1. Verify base_version == curr_head (First-Committer-Wins via CAS)                         |   |
|   |   2. Generate Commit LSN & Stage WAL payload                                             |   |
|   |   3. MPSC WalRingBuffer::enqueue(WalRecord)                                              |   |
|   |   4. futex_wait(&record.persisted_lsn, NOT_DURABLE)                                      |   |
|   |   5. On wake: CAS publish version to PageVersion head with memory_order_release          |   |
|   |   6. EpochManager::retire_version(old_version)                                           |   |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
+=============================================|====================================================+
                                              | Enqueue WAL
                                              v
+==================================================================================================+
|                         LOCK-FREE MPSC WAL RING BUFFER & 4KB SECTOR ALIGNMENT                    |
|                                                                                                  |
|   Producer Tail  [ atomic<uint64_t> alloc_cursor ] ---> Ticket reservation (AcqRel)             |
|   Buffer Slots   [ Block 0 ][ Block 1 ][ Block 2 ] ... [ Block N ] (4096-byte Direct I/O chunks) |
|   Ready Cursor   [ atomic<uint64_t> ready_cursor ] ---> Multi-producer commit synchronization    |
+=============================================|====================================================+
                                              | Batch Drain
                                              v
+==================================================================================================+
|                       `io_uring` WAL PERSISTENCE SUBSYSTEM (DIRECT I/O)                          |
|                                                                                                  |
|   +--------------------------+    IORING_OP_WRITEV     +-------------------------------------+   |
|   | Submission Queue (SQ)    | ----------------------> | Linux Kernel VFS / NVMe Driver      |   |
|   | Direct I/O (O_DIRECT)    |                         | (Submits 4KB-aligned block batches) |   |
|   +--------------------------+                         +-------------------------------------+   |
|                ^                                                          |                      |
|                |                                                          v                      |
|   +--------------------------+      CQE Harvesting     +-------------------------------------+   |
|   | LSN Watermark Sliding    | <---------------------- | Completion Queue (CQ)               |   |
|   | Window (Out-of-order map)|                         | (Tracks sparse block completions)   |   |
|   +--------------------------+                         +-------------------------------------+   |
|                |                                                                                 |
|                v                                                                                 |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
|   | Global Persistent LSN Advance                                                            |   |
|   |   1. Advance GlobalPersistentLSN = max_contiguous(completed_lsn)                        |   |
|   |   2. Futex wake (FUTEX_WAKE_PRIVATE) all threads waiting on LSN <= GlobalPersistentLSN   |   |
|   +------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+   |
+==================================================================================================+
```

### 1.2 Version Chain Node Structure

```
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                  PageVersion Node                                     |
+------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------+
| uint64_t commit_ts                 | Commit timestamp (generation counter)            |
| uint64_t lsn                       | Write-Ahead Log LSN required for visibility      |
| uint64_t page_id                   | Logical Page Identifier                          |
| alignas(64) atomic<PageVersion*>   | Pointer to predecessor version (older)           |
| alignas(64) atomic<uint32_t>       | Hazard reference / lease count (stall fallback)   |
| uint32_t payload_size              | Size of page delta/frame payload                 |
| uint8_t  payload_data[PAGE_SIZE]   | Immutable 4KB page frame buffer                  |
+------------------------------------+--------------------------------------------------+
```

### 1.3 Transaction State Machine

```
     [INIT]
       |
       | Read working set snapshot (T_read)
       v
  [EXECUTING]
       |
       | Generate writes, execute delta operations in local thread-private buffer
       v
  [VALIDATE] ------------(CAS failed / Newer commit detected)------------> [ABORT / RETRY]
       |
       | CAS validates base_version == head
       v
 [WAL_QUEUED]
       |
       | Reserved LSN in MPSC Ring Buffer; Payload submitted to io_uring SQ
       v
  [PERSISTING]
       |
       | Blocked on futex_wait(lsn)
       v
  [DURABLE]
       |
       | CQE harvested; sliding window advances contiguous durable LSN watermark
       | Futex signals worker; atomic CAS links PageVersion to Page Chain Head
       v
  [VISIBLE]
       |
       | Snapshot readers with T_read >= T_commit can view node
       v
  [RECLAIMED] (EpochManager advances past retirement epoch; Memory safe for reuse)
```

